        </a></dd>

        
                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>A heuristic computational algorithm designed to find optimal solutions in a random search space. Particle swarm optimization measures swarm intelligence which is a computation measurement inspired by behaviors of self-organized swarming animals.</dd>
                </span>
            
                <dt>Entry Term(s)</dt>
                <dd>
                    Classical PSO
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Classical Particle Swarm Optimization
                    
